  "content": "<p>這個模組新增了一座詭異的女巫小屋，外形像一顆巨大的南瓜，裡面住著女巫，還藏有隱藏戰利品。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1360/514/house.png\" width=\"390\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1360/515/inside.png\" width=\"390\"></p><p>在裡面，你會發現：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>女巫</strong>&nbsp;住在南瓜裡面</li>\n<li><strong>隱藏戰利品</strong>與釀造材料</li>\n<li>神秘又溫馨的氛圍</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1360/516/upstairs.png\" width=\"390\"></p><p>南瓜女巫小屋會自然生成在<strong>森林</strong>、<strong>針葉林</strong>、<strong>黑森林</strong>和<strong>沼澤</strong>生態系中。<br><br></p><hr><p>歡迎將它放入你的模組包中！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
